      lines: ['Hi, I’m Linh. My brother’s name is Minh. He’s a driver, and he’s a little tired after work. My sister is Mai. She’s a teacher, and she’s at home today. She likes cooking dinner for our parents.', 'Our parents live near a park. They’re friendly, and they’re always happy to see us. We’re a close family. On Sundays, we’re often at a café near the supermarket. It’s a small café, and it’s open for breakfast. The coffee is good. We eat breakfast together and talk about our week. After breakfast, we ride our bikes to the park.', 'he’s‿a driver', 'she’s‿a teacher', 'it’s‿a small café', 'we’re‿often', 'they’re‿always', 'Luyện 2 lượt rồi ghi âm 1 lượt, khoảng 60–90 giây. Giữ âm cuối và nhịp câu tự nhiên.'],
